window.products.push({"id":164116,"name":"ICEPURE 2-in-1 Water Cooler Dispenser with Built-in Ice Maker, Hot/Cold/Room Temp Water, Top Loading 2, 3 or 5 Gallon Water Dispenser, 26.5 Lbs/24H Ic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516Voy8ZHOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💧【Authenticity Guarantee】---ICEPURE 2-in-1 Water Cooler Dispenser with built-in ice maker has ETL, FCC, and UL Certifications. All materials in contact with water are food grade, ensuring a healthy and clean experience. With thorough inspections carried out on each device before leaving the factory, you can rest assured that ICEPURE offers only the highest standards of safety and convenience. Choose ICEPURE, Choose a convenient and assured life. 💧【Powerful Function】---This machine combines a water dispenser and an ice maker into one machine, saving space in small kitchens or offices.32.0℉ Ice water, 194.0℉ Hot water,73.4℉ Room temp water, 26.5lbs/24Hours. Whether in hot summer or a chillsome winter, our water cooler with an ice maker can meet your needs. The child safety lock prevents the accidental outflow of hot water. Overload Protection and Anti-dry Heating Protection Functions make your family at ease to use. 💧【Fast & Efficient】--- The Top Loading Water Dispenser can produce 9 bullet-shaped ice pieces at a time in 7-15mins, while can also delivering hot or cool water within 5 minutes. The built-in ice maker can make 26.5 lbs of ice cubes per day. With an automatic stop-making when the ice basket is full, you won't have to worry about overproduction. The bullet-shaped ice cubes are perfect for quickly cooling drinks, fruits, or food on hot summer days without melting or sticking together. 💧【Accessible to Use】---The water cooler dispenser requires no installation and no need to connect inlet and drain pipes. The control panel is user-friendly, making it easy to operate. All you have to do is load a 2, 3, or 5-gallon water jug on the top of the dispenser, then you can start enjoying refreshing cool water and ice cubes in just minutes. And the high-quality compressor makes the water dispenser works almost silently, ensuring you won't be disturbed while working or resting. 💧【Quality Guarantee】--- ICEPURE is an American company. Our factory has been producing high-quality water treatment products for 20+ years. The water machine is made with food-grade and BPA-free materials, fashionable, exquisite appearance. The water and ice dispenser is an ideal choice for environmentally-conscious consumers who want to reduce their energy consumption. 24H customer service, seven-day no-reason return or exchange, and we also provide a one-year warranty service for free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516Voy8ZHOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICEPURE","source_asin":"B0BPFR89BC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-164116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPFR89BC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPFR89BC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
