window.products.push({"id":164452,"name":"Cooksir Electric Cooktop 2 Burner, Plug in Electric Stove Top Stainless Steel 110V, Hot Surface Indicator, Overheat Protection, Ceramic Cooktop with 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VcZpn8VnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Stainless Steel Electric Cooktop with Plug】 The 2 burners electric cooktop can work at 110-120v and comes with a plug, so you don't need to worry about wiring to the home electric box, simply speaking, you can use it wherever there is an outlet. The body of this electric stove is made of stainless steel, which is much lighter in weight compared to the glass one. 【Portable Electric Stovetop 2 Burners】 12 inch electric cooktop has two knobs with 7 adjustable power levels, which can control the temperature more accurately and meet various cooking modes, like steam, deep fry, stir-fry, roast. (1200W+600W)Two burners of the 120v electric cooktop can work at the same time and the heating capacity not be affected, which can save you half of the cooking time. 【Knob Control Electric Stove Top】 Cooksir portable electric stovetop is very simple to use, it has no complex button. It just has two knobs, one knob controls one burner. The elderly can also use the 110v electric cooktop easily. Compared with other touch ceramic cooktop, the electric stove equipped with a knob is more suitable for the elderly and people with weak eyesight. 【Easy to Clean】 The heating panel of two burner electric cooktop is a ceramic panel, which is easy to clean. Just wipe it with a damp cloth. After cooking, there is still residual heat on the stovetop and the indicator light is still on, so please take care to wait for the temperature to cool down before cleaning. The ceramic stovetop provides heat to the food by self-generating heat from the internal coils, there is no electromagnetic radiation, pregnant can use it too. 【Compatible with any Cookwares】The advantage of electric ceramic stove is that it is compatible with any flat-bottomed cookers. As long as it is a pan, it can be heated on electric hot plate. When moving and placing pots and pans, please be careful to place them from top to bottom instead of moving them flat on the stove top. If you encounter any problems in the process of using, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VcZpn8VnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cooksir","source_asin":"B0C68T1QGX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-164452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C68T1QGX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C68T1QGX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
