window.products.push({"id":164693,"name":"SMETA Refrigerator for Kitchen Full Size Refrigerators 21 Cu.Ft Top Freezer LED light White Garage Ready Top Mount Large Capacity Total Frost Free Dou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lowsBZn-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【Basic Refrigerators for kitchen】 21 Cu. Ft top freezer refrigerator, total frost-free design, integrated circulating air, more efficient and stable refrigeration. Two sections: a freezer up top, and a refrigerator on the bottom. Freezer compartment can be used for storing frozen foods or making ice cubes (Ice maker ready), keep ingredients fresh for longer without drying out. ❄【Apartment Size Refrigerator】 W*D*H:32.8*32.3*66.2(ins). Total 21 Cu. Ft, with 6 Cu. Ft freezer, with both doors of the refrigerator have large storage space. Perfect size suitable for University Dormitory, RV, Apartment, or Office. (More models in our SMETA store for more needs). ❄【Removable Glass Shelves and Doors】 The refrigerator with freezer comes with two removable spill proof glass shelves and doors, that make it easy to clean and make space for additional storage. A detachable slide-out glass shelf adds to the variety of ways you may organize your storage needs. Freezer door rack for extra storage, gallon door racks make it easy to store tall items and beverages. ❄【Adjustable Electrical Thermostat Control】 This apartment fridge offers 5 conversion modes, Double vegetable and fruit crispers with humidity controller that make your life easier. Keep the stored food and beverages at the chilled temperature of your liking. ❄【More User-Friendly Details】 Interior light （LED optional）, Grip handle, Easy rolling wheels, Diary room, Low-Energy consumption compressor, Low-Noise. The refrigerator with freezer with a 12-month warranty on parts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lowsBZn-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMETA","source_asin":"B09128NR2F","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-164693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09128NR2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09128NR2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":164694,"name":"306508 Front Glide Kit by Seentech, Compatible With Whirlpool May-tag Dryers – Replaces: 306508VP AP4037304 PS1804752 - Pack of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71548yt1yWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ MODEL NUMBER: 2 x 306508 Front Glide Kit - Replaces part number: 306508VP AP4037304, PS1804752, AP4037304, 1309, 3-12941, 3-6508, 312941, AH1804752, DE747, EA1804752, K35-603, PS1804752 ✅ PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS: The drum rides along the front glide, which is located at the front of the dryer. When your dryer is running, you may hear a metal-on-metal noise, which means your front glide is worn out and needs to be replaced. A blue plastic glide, a brown cork pad, and two metallic rivets are included in this front glide kit. Each appliance requires two kits. While you're removing the front bulkhead for this repair, look over the felt that lines it. It is recommended that you replace the felt at the same time if it is damaged. ✅ EASY TO INSTALL: It is made exactly fit different brands (May-tag, International, Jenn-Air, Crosley). FitsModels: - [Crosley]: CDE4205AYJ CDE4205AYW CDE4205AZJ CDE4205AZW CDG4205AWJ CDG4205AWW... -[Maytag]: DE106 DE107 DE110 DE180 DE18CA DE18CM DE18CS DE18CT DE19CA DE19CD LDE7304AGE LDE7304AGL LDE7304AGM LDE7314ACE LDE7314ACL LDE7314ACM LDE7314ADE LDE7334ACE LDE7334ACL LDE7334ACM LDE7600ACW LDE7600ADL LDE7600ADW LDE7600ADW LDE7600AGW LDE810 LDE8200 LDE8200ACE LDE8200ACL LDE8200ACW LDE8200ACW LDE8200ACW LDE8404ACE LDE8404ACL LDE8404ACL LDE8410ACL LDE8410ACW LDE8410ADE etc,... ✅ HIGH-QUALITY PART: The replacement part is made from durable high quality material and well-tested by the manufacturer - Ensure long-lasting and effective performance. This part fixes the following symptoms: Noisy | Marks left on clothes | Will not tumble | Will Not Start ✅ MONEY-BACK GUARANTEE: Please check the model number carefully before ordering. If you are unsure about the compatibility, you can send us your dryer model number, we can help you confirm if it fits or not. 30 days free return and exchange,for any reason, you are not satisfied, you can request a replacement or a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71548yt1yWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seentech","source_asin":"B0B9FZX79T","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-164694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9FZX79T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9FZX79T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
